Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Advisor: clean-spot coverage in eluent selection

Selection now has three goals: visibility, resolution, and every spot (starting materials + High/Medium products) running clean in at least one chosen eluent. Adds a clean-spot term to the combination search (cleanSpotWeight, default 0.10), keeps an eluent in the pruning step when it is the only clean option for enough wells, and reports wells with no clean option in the set or in any candidate.

